Dual license: SIL Open Font License version 1.1, and GNU GPL version 2
or later with the GNU Font Embedding Exception.

  - SIL Open Font License v1.1: https://scripts.sil.org/OFL
  - GNU GPL v2 or later:        https://gnu.org/licenses/gpl.html

Used here (under the OFL) as an embeddable pan-Unicode font so that
tracking-sheet PDFs can render titles and metadata in any Basic
Multilingual Plane script (Latin, Cyrillic, Greek, Arabic, CJK,
Hangul, Kana, etc.).
